### GET request to example server
GET https://examples.http-client.intellij.net/get
    ?generated-in=IntelliJ IDEA

<dependency>
    <groupId>org.springframework.boot</groupId>
    <artifactId>spring-boot-starter-security</artifactId>
</dependency>
### 1 Warehouse
POST http://localhost:8080/api/warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Main Warehouse","location":"Pune"}

### 2 Category
POST http://localhost:8080/api/categories
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Electronics"}

### 3 Supplier
POST http://localhost:8080/api/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"ABC Traders","email":"abc@mail.com","phone":"9999999999"}

### 4 Product
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"P001","name":"Keyboard","price":999.00,"lowStockThreshold":10,"categoryId":1,"supplierId":1}

### 5 Stock in
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/stock-in
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"warehouseId":1,"quantity":50,"remarks":"Initial"}

### 6 Stock out
POST http://localhost:8080/api/inventory/stock-out
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":1,"warehouseId":1,"quantity":45}